<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Roadway cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Roadway cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co analyst Steve Lewins said he downgraded Roadway Express Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- He cited &quot;new uncertainties stemming from results of the Teamsters election.&quot;</p>
<p>-- He said he also trimmed his 1996 earnings estimate to $1.00 per share from $1.10 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the trucking company were up 1-1/4 to 16-3/8.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
